#---
# purpose: "A call on an atom literal that names no module, :nosuch.thing(1), is refused at compile time as a qualified call to an undefined module is, so it never reaches run time"
# expect: diagnostic
# diagnostic.code: resolve/unknown-module
#---
#
# The atom is a module's name whether the module is written as an alias or as
# a bare atom, so the literal is resolved where a qualified call is.
def main() do
  IO.puts(:nosuch.thing(1))
end
